ut-id\">Withdrawal to M-Pesa<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"payout-date\">12 May 2026<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n        <div class=\"payout-amount\">KSh 500<\/div>\r\n        <span class=\"payout-status\">Paid \u00b7 0254XXXX12<\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\">\r\n      <div class=\"payout-left\">\r\n        <div class=\"payout-dot\"><\/div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div class=\"payout-id\">Withdrawal to M-Pesa<\/div>\r\n          <div class=\"payout-date\">29 March 2026<\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n        <div class=\"payout-amount\">KSh 650<\/div>\r\n        <span class=\"payout-status\">Paid \u00b7 0254XXXX12<\/span>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\r\n    <h3>\ud83d\udcca Earnings breakdown<\/h3>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:18px;\">\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\" style=\"padding:10px 0;\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Surveys completed this month<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">2<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\" style=\"padding:10px 0;\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Average reward per survey<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">KSh 75<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\" style=\"padding:10px 0; border-bottom:none;\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Lifetime earnings<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">KSh 1,300<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ====================== REFER PANEL ====================== -->\r\n<section id=\"panel-refer\" class=\"panel\" hidden>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"card summary-card\">\r\n    <div class=\"summary-top\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <div class=\"summary-label\">Referral earnings<\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"summary-value\">KSh 0<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n      <div class=\"status-chip\">0 active referrals<\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"threshold-note\" style=\"margin-top:14px; color:#C9D6EC;\">\r\n      You earn KSh 30 when someone you refer completes their first paid survey \u2014 not just for signing up. This keeps the program tied to real activity rather than empty signups.\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\r\n    <h3>\ud83d\udd17 Your referral link<\/h3>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:18px;\">\r\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px;\">\r\n      <input type=\"text\" readonly value=\"surveypesa.co.ke\/r\/K29-XJ4\"\r\n        style=\"flex:1; padding:12px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--border); background:var(--bg); font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text);\">\r\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"flex:none; padding:12px 18px;\" onclick=\"copyReferral(this)\">Copy<\/button>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <p class=\"section-sub\" style=\"margin:12px 0 0;\">Share this with people genuinely interested in paid research \u2014 referrals are only credited after a real completed survey, so there's no benefit to mass-sharing.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\r\n    <h3>\ud83d\udc65 Your referrals<\/h3>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:24px 18px; text-align:center;\">\r\n    <div style=\"font-size:28px; margin-bottom:8px;\">\ud83c\udf31<\/div>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mute);\">No referrals yet. Once someone you've invited completes their first survey, they'll show up here along with your KSh 30 bonus.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"card terms-card\">\r\n    <h4>How the referral bonus works<\/h4>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>You get KSh 30 once your referral completes one paid survey \u2014 not for signing up alone.<\/li>\r\n      <li>Bonuses are added to your earned balance and count toward the KSh 500 payout minimum.<\/li>\r\n      <li>There's no limit to how many people you can refer.<\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ====================== PROFILE PANEL ====================== -->\r\n<section id=\"panel-profile\" class=\"panel\" hidden>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"card summary-card\">\r\n    <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;\">\r\n      <div style=\"width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--lime); color:var(--navy-deep); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:800; font-size:22px;\">\ud83d\udc4b<\/div>\r\n      <div>\r\n        <div style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:700;\">Welcome back<\/div>\r\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9FB1CE;\">Member since 12 March 2026<\/div>\r\n      <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\r\n    <h3>\ud83c\udfaf Survey profile<\/h3>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <p class=\"section-sub\">Surveys are matched to this profile. Keeping it accurate increases how many you qualify for.<\/p>\r\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:4px 18px;\">\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Age range<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">25\u201334<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Location<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">Nairobi County<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-mute);\">Interests<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:14px;\">Finance, Food, Mobile tech<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" style=\"width:100%; margin-top:12px; background:white; color:var(--navy); border:1.5px solid var(--navy);\">Edit profile<\/button>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\r\n    <h3>\u2699\ufe0f Settings<\/h3>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:4px 18px;\">\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Notify me about new surveys<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--green);\">On<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"payout-row\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">\r\n      <span style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Notify me about referral bonuses<\/span>\r\n      <strong style=\"font-size:13px; color:var(--green);\">On<\/strong>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" style=\"width:100%; margin-top:18px; background:white; color:#C0392B; border:1.5px solid #E8B4AC;\">Log out<\/button>\r\n\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<\/main>\r\n\r\n<nav class=\"bottomnav\">\r\n  <div class=\"nav-item active\" data-panel=\"home\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">\ud83c\udfe0<\/span>Home<\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"nav-item\" data-panel=\"wallet\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">\ud83d\udcb0<\/span>Wallet<\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"nav-item\" data-panel=\"refer\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">\ud83d\udc65<\/span>Refer<\/div>\r\n  <div class=\"nav-item\" data-panel=\"profile\"><span class=\"nav-icon\">\ud83d\udc64<\/span>Profile<\/div>\r\n<\/nav>\r\n<script>\r\n  function applyToSurvey(btn) {\r\n    if (btn.disabled) return;\r\n\r\n    const card = btn.closest('.survey-card');\r\n    const meterRow = card.querySelector('.queue-meter-row strong');\r\n    const bar = card.querySelector('.queue-bar-fill');\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Bump the real applicant count by one, since this user just applied\r\n    if (meterRow) {\r\n      const match = meterRow.textContent.match(\/(\\d+)\\s+of\\s+(\\d+)\/);\r\n      if (match) {\r\n        const filled = Math.min(parseInt(match[1], 10) + 1, parseInt(match[2], 10));\r\n        const total = parseInt(match[2], 10);\r\n        meterRow.textContent = `${filled} of ${total} applicants`;\r\n        if (bar) bar.style.width = Math.round((filled \/ total) * 100) + '%';\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    btn.textContent = 'Applied \u2014 pending review';\r\n    btn.classList.add('applied');\r\n    btn.disabled = true;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function notifyMe(btn) {\r\n    if (btn.classList.contains('notified')) return;\r\n    btn.textContent = \"You'll be notified when this opens\";\r\n    btn.classList.add('notified');\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function copyReferral(btn) {\r\n    const input = btn.previousElementSibling;\r\n    input.select();\r\n    document.execCommand('copy');\r\n    const original = btn.textContent;\r\n    btn.textContent = 'Copied';\r\n    setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = original; }, 1500);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/\/ ---- Tab navigation ----\r\n  const navItems = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item');\r\n  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.panel');\r\n  const banner = document.getElementById('activation-banner');\r\n\r\n  function goToPanel(target) {\r\n    \/\/ Highlight the matching bottom-nav tab if one exists (Browse has none \u2014 falls back to Home)\r\n    navItems.forEach(i => i.classList.toggle('active', i.dataset.panel === target));\r\n\r\n    panels.forEach(p => {\r\n      p.hidden = (p.id !== `panel-${target}`);\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    \/\/ Activation banner is only relevant on the Home tab\r\n    if (banner) banner.style.display = (target === 'home') ? 'flex' : 'none';\r\n\r\n    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'instant' });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  navItems.forEach(item => {\r\n    item.addEventListener('click', () => goToPanel(item.dataset.panel));\r\n  });\r\n<\/script>\r\n<\/body>\r\n<\/html>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Survey Pesa \u2014 Your Dashboard Survey Pesa \ud83d\udc4b Welcome back \u2705 Your account is active \u2014 thank you You can now apply to surveys and request payouts once you reach the KSh 500 minimum. No further action needed. Earned balance KSh 150 Active since today Progress to payout minimum KSh 150 \/ KSh 500 M-Pesa [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_canvas","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-1687","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1687","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1687"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1687\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1694,"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1687\/revisions\/1694"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/surveypesa.co.ke\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1687"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}